    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can enjoy it repeatedly with multiplayer and score ranking support!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped on a train that runs forever. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's worse, the train is filled with countless versions of YOU, all looking exactly like YOU... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay close attention and find the one different YOU among the eight, then make your way to the last car and reach the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>[Guide]</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Look closely at all 8 YOUs.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If just 1 is different, criticize them.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>If not, go forward.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pass through 8 cars to get out.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game modes include 'One Player' and 'Two Players'!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'One Player', you can enjoy a score attack as you try to escape on your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 'Two Players', you can race alongside another player to compete for the fastest escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support for score rankings has been added.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score rankings are now available for each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge '<i>8 YOUs</i>' players from around the world based on your scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can add the successfully identified YOU to your 'Collection' with the criticize action!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 88 different versions of YOU. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim to complete all the different versions of YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are 3 stages in total.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under certain conditions, 2 additional stages will unlock...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please enjoy the enhanced <i>'8 YOUs+'</i> now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is an extended version of the mini-game included in 'KUUKIYOMI 4: Consider It'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please ensure you understand this before making your purchase.</i></p>",
