rtain conditions, 2 additional stages will unlock...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Please enjoy the enhanced <i>'8 YOUs+'</i> now!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is an extended version of the mini-game included in 'KUUKIYOMI 4: Consider It'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please ensure you understand this before making your purchase.</i></p>",
